        "TileImage": "$($repository cdef527b-e581-49c4-82d5-5b5c0bc7441b).Image",
        "Description": "Your investigation yielded results 47. Professors at MIT studied the scriptures you found and they indeed reference the &quot;Lost Ark&quot;. Some shipping memos you found also indicate that a dig site was established in connection to the artifact in Colombia, and names appear that further indicate the Russians. Your job is to eliminate the Russian assets in charge of the dig site, and the main archeologist Dan Buckman, then take the helicopter which hosts whatever they dug up there. Good luck 47!",
